Hi,

I have posted a lot about the new list, so this should be my
last post until Monday.

Our new software allows for software agency. That means writing a
piece of code (perl, C, etc.) take can examine every message to the
list, accept commands, process commands and make posts including
reposts of messages.

Our initial agent is the filter-agent. It can exclude and/or include
messages by poster, thread, and regular expressions. We also have an
agent that handles digests

We are not adding other agents at this time so we can monitor our CPU
usage.

